flowchart TD
    Caller["CLI adapter or Rust host"] --> Operation["Read typed run status"]
    Operation --> Binding{"Database binding"}
    Binding -->|standalone operator| Run["Read control run"]
    Binding -->|restricted| Context["Fixed-role pool and transaction-local context"]
    Context --> Run
    Run --> Exists{"Run exists?"}
    Exists -->|no| Missing["NotFound"]
    Exists -->|yes| Creating{"Creation-owned status?"}
    Creating -->|yes| Creation["Read control creation progress"]
    Creating -->|no| Routes["Resolve and validate shard routes"]
    Routes --> Summaries["Read summaries grouped by database<br/>restricted bindings own local transactions"]
    Summaries --> Progress["Combine summaries or use control fallback"]
    Creation --> Result["Typed snapshot and completeness"]
    Progress --> Result
    Result --> Cleanup["Finish read transactions and clear context"]
    Cleanup --> Presentation["Caller formats output"]
    Operation -. dependency failure .-> Failure["Rollback owned transaction<br/>Typed dependency error"]
